  "description": "The \u0027users_prepared\u0027 dataset provides a comprehensive overview of user information, including login credentials, profile details, and activity metrics. This dataset is particularly useful for managing user accounts, analyzing user behavior, and tracking user engagement over time. Key features include email addresses, display names, user profiles, and group memberships, which help in identifying and categorizing users. Additionally, the dataset tracks user activity through timestamps of account creation, last successful login, and last session activity, allowing for detailed analysis of user engagement. The \u0027enabled\u0027 column indicates whether a user account is active, while the \u0027days_since_last_activity_or_login\u0027 provides insights into user inactivity. The dataset also includes URLs for user account management, facilitating easy access to user profiles. This dataset is ideal for administrators and analysts looking to monitor user activity, manage user accounts, and enhance user experience by understanding user interactions and engagement patterns.",
